//   - [ErrIrsInfosNotInitialized]: The information structure gesv_irs_infos was not created.
//   - [ErrIrsNotSupported]: One of the configuration parameter in the gesv_irs_params structure is not supported. For example if nrhs >1, and refinement solver was set to [IrsRefineGmres].
//   - [ErrIrsOutOfRange]: Numerical error related to niters <0, see niters description for more details.
//   - [ErrIrsParamsInvalid]: One of the configuration parameter in the gesv_irs_params structure is not valid.
//   - [ErrIrsParamsInvalidMaxiter]: The maxiter configuration parameter in the gesv_irs_params structure is not valid.
//   - [ErrIrsParamsInvalidPrec]: The main and/or the lowest precision configuration parameter in the gesv_irs_params structure is not valid, check the table above for the supported combinations.
//   - [ErrIrsParamsInvalidRefine]: The refinement solver configuration parameter in the gesv_irs_params structure is not valid.
//   - [ErrIrsParamsNotInitialized]: The configuration parameter gesv_irs_params structure was not created.
//   - [ErrNotInitialized]: The library was not initialized.
